        <mxCell id="notes" value="Configuration notes&#10;• Subnet availability_zone variables are not used by resources.&#10;• Private route table has no NAT / internet default route.&#10;• Cluster default capacity provider: FARGATE_SPOT.&#10;• ACM validation wait resource is commented out.&#10;Dashed arrows represent DNS, configuration, or service dependencies." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=14;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1">
